From d337038169cd36a8ed6602b115b2269a074903da Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 20:15:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] UI-OPTIONS: Options rebuilt (nine tabs, groups, one-line
 help, detail card, Y reset, previews, page memory)

Pages Quick, Game, Life, Display, Sound, Controls, Access, Perf, Cheats: a row's page is its .page in the
option tables, its place the layout arrays of fp_options.c (max 12 rows a page, at most 3 group headers).
One strip with every page (icons, the open one by name), a row counter in the header, one help line per row
(rewritten, at most 36 letters), a detail card behind SELECT (X where there is none) for the long texts, Y
puts one row back (never Language or Monster Mode), a gold dot marks a changed row, previews for Crosshair,
Field of view, Text speed, Clock and HUD layout, volume rows blip, one hint bar of three actions, the page
left is the page Options opens on again. The backdrop leaves out what the window covers (exact). Option ids,
OPT / OPT2 and the preset and reset rules are unchanged. Tests: census, fit in every ready language,
cursor / Y / card / memory. Spanish for the new strings in ui_opts.tsv.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xd63czLgdbSn871LSJKjVC
